deb73480d18b5f","layer":"original","quote":"安坐党鲁王霸，死〖10〗。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":35,"end":48},{"id":"hequan-q-4561bcf5e5de173e78bb","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-6c5f593279f7e62e0019","layer":"pei","quote":"次子寄，坐阿党鲁王霸，赐死","attribution":"裴注·《吴书》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-745969b04e6140fa105c","start":83,"end":96},{"id":"luxun-e-o054c-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-03ef9029e4f75daea2ea","layer":"original","quote":"太子太傅吾粲，坐数与逊交书，下狱死。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":61,"end":79},{"id":"luxun-q-b-130a5e16c8341db29d46","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-130a5e16c8341db29d46","layer":"modern","quote":"〖15〗二宫：指太子孙和与鲁王孙霸的宫府。阙：（侍从官员有）空缺。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-a8c919336e3925a1e25e","start":0,"end":33},{"id":"luxun-q-o052","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-9069564ba3deaa3c0f41","layer":"original","quote":"先是，二宫并阙〖15〗；中外职司〖16〗，多遣子弟给侍。全琮报逊，逊以为：“子弟苟有才，不忧不用，不宜私出以要荣利〖17〗；若其不佳，终为取祸。且闻二宫势敌，必有彼此，此古人之厚忌也。”琮子寄，果阿附鲁王，轻为交构〖18〗。逊书与琮曰：“卿不师日!〖19〗，而宿留阿寄〖20〗，终为足下门户致祸矣。”琮既不纳，更以致隙〖21〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":164},{"id":"luxun-q-o053","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-9e0895516d189f3b434e","layer":"original","quote":"及太子有不安之议，逊上疏陈：“太子正统，宜有盘石之固；鲁王藩臣，当使宠秩有差〖22〗；彼此得所，上下获安。谨叩头流血以闻。”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":247,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62},{"id":"panlu-q-453e992432eeed68e490","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-2f8f206f4f039d83c0a9","layer":"pei","quote":"太子自惧黜废，而鲁王觊觎益甚。权时见杨竺，辟左右而论霸之才；竺深述霸有文武英姿，宜为嫡嗣：于是权乃许立焉","attribution":"裴注·《吴录》","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-90be1bc5b1a157bbf567","start":10,"end":62},{"id":"panlu-q-90c1a58221a216cbb567","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-b41003707cccf82182ea","layer":"original","quote":"会全寄，杨竺等阿附鲁王霸，与和分争，阴相谮构","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":54},{"id":"santizhu059-q-2d1409f3539abf443872","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-b6e75bb104a45779f56b","layer":"pei","quote":"初，权既立和为太子，而封霸为鲁王。初拜，犹同宫室，礼秩未分。","attribution":"裴注·殷基《通语》","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":182,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dd8f362aa12f2b2ad583","start":12,"end":42},{"id":"santizhu059-q-593edad90431345fdaeb","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-664ca816c1bb0d8b5184","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，和、霸不穆之声闻于权耳〖1〗；权禁断往来，假以精学〖2〗。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":225,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":20,"end":52},{"id":"santizhu059-q-e1d8884fd529e9e75a5e","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-4b82ceb061997a002877","layer":"original","quote":"时全寄、吴安、孙奇、杨竺等，阴共附霸，图危太子。谮毁既行，太子以败，霸亦赐死","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38},{"id":"santizhu059-q-f5c695232dc8ff7315a1","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-f77eaac96e37b2d3db4c","layer":"original","quote":"陆逊、吾粲、顾谭等数陈嫡庶之义，理不可夺；全寄、杨竺为鲁王霸支党，谮诉日兴〖6〗。粲遂下狱诛，谭徙交州","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-33155276d789f594176b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33155276d789f594176b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：嘉平二年（公元 250）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-235bc158a4eae2a0609a","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-f25c29f875d80e25ad66","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f25c29f875d80e25ad66","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：正始三年（公元 242）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0c94d6c7ec4663a4ff7d","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o015","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-928dff832b77cf5f2f14","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，东平王徽薨〖2〗。三月，太尉满宠薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27},{"id":"shaodi-q-o046","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8bc97b77985c9cc83eeb","layer":"original","quote":"二年夏五月〖13〗，以征西将军郭淮为车骑将军〖14〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o137b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-fb43c4f02a5cae882f38","layer":"original","quote":"是岁大疫。有司又奏立后及诸王。八月，立子霸为鲁王〖9〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":28,"end":56},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o159b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-cab648dda000f8546177","layer":"original","quote":"废太子和〖17〗，处故鄣；鲁王霸，赐死。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":59,"end":79},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o135","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-692e948ed8fd30650c98","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，立子和为太子〖2〗。大赦，改禾兴为嘉兴。百官奏立皇后及四王，诏曰：“今天下不定，民物劳瘁〖3〗；且有功者或未录，饥寒者尚未恤；猥割土壤以丰子弟〖4〗，崇爵位以宠妃妾：孤甚不取。其释此议。”三月，海盐县言黄龙现〖5〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":193,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":117},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o137","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-fb43c4f02a5cae882f38","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，遣将军聂友、校尉陆凯，以兵三万讨珠崖儋耳〖8〗。是岁大疫。有司又奏立后及诸王。八月，立子霸为鲁王〖9〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o158","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-781d2f88aede8a4f2628","layer":"original","quote":"十三年夏五月〖10〗，日至〖11〗，荧惑入南斗〖12〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":265,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o159","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-cab648dda000f8546177","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，犯魁第二星而东〖13〗。八月，丹杨句容及故鄣、宁国诸山崩〖14〗，洪水溢。诏原逋责〖15〗，给贷种食〖16〗。废太子和〖17〗，处故鄣；鲁王霸，赐死。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p076-judgment","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-69fcfbf889ec41c68ff7","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞臣松之以为：孙权横废无罪之子，虽为兆乱；然国之倾覆，自由暴皓。若权不废和，皓为世嫡，终至灭亡，有何异哉！此则丧国由于昏虐，不在于废黜也。设使亮保国祚，休不早死，则皓不得立；皓不得立，则吴不亡矣。","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":341,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-02886fb29e73419f9247","start":0,"end":100},{"id":"yaoci-q-30f312b2eb4ed0a35817","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-2f17a96cb44e22570a99","layer":"original","quote":"后权为子霸，纳基女；赐第一区","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"yululu-q-715d3201e4b91dc9a135","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-12487deb4f8058d89b8b","layer":"original","quote":"由此为霸、竺等所谮害，下狱诛","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":447,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":75,"end":89},{"id":"yululu-q-eb1d161d5b6c68234406","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-12487deb4f8058d89b8b","layer":"original","quote":"迁太子太傅，遭二宫之变〖14〗。抗言执正〖15〗，明嫡庶之分；欲使鲁王霸出驻夏口，遣杨竺不得令在都邑〖16〗。又数以消息语陆逊，逊时驻武昌，连表谏争。由此为霸、竺等所谮害，下狱诛〖17〗。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":447,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94},{"id":"zhanggu-q-5753a1dfe780c42876e8","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-b40c947750c1f3ef6493","layer":"original","quote":"是时，鲁王霸有盛宠，与太子和齐衡。谭上疏曰：“臣闻有国有家者，必明嫡庶之端，异尊卑之礼；使高下有差，阶级逾邈〖8〗。如此则骨肉之恩生，觊觎之望绝。昔贾谊陈治安之计〖9〗，论诸侯之势，以为：势重，虽亲必有逆节之累〖10〗；势轻，虽疏必有保全之祚〖11〗。故淮南亲弟〖12〗，不终飨国〖13〗，失之于势重也；吴芮疏臣〖14〗，传祚长沙，得之于势轻也。昔汉文帝使慎夫人与皇后同席〖15〗，袁盎退夫人之座〖16〗，帝有怒色。及盎辨上下之仪，陈人彘之戒〖17〗；帝既悦怿，夫人亦悟。今臣所陈，非有所偏〖18〗；诚欲以安太子，而便鲁王也。”由是霸与谭有隙。","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":196,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":272},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d95ac6b70220ae016119","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-0ccf265f45e5a3e57842","layer":"original","quote":"为鲁王霸友党所谮，与顾谭、承俱以“芍陂论功事〖19〗，休、承与典军陈恂通情，诈增其伐〖20〗”，并徙交州","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52},{"id":"zhulv-q-9a21ef299a2b945f66d3","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-461f3afa77540e474f4b","layer":"original","quote":"鲁王霸注意交绩〖5〗，尝至其廨〖6〗，就之坐〖7〗，欲与结好；绩下地住立〖8〗，辞而不当","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":73,"end":117}],"profiles":{"wuzhu-p0116":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"wu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
